Also in this image, on the lower right is a snake-like, legless amphibian from the genus Ophiderpeton.  Flying overhead and resembling a giant dragonfly is a prehistoric insect from the genus Meganeura. The tree-like plants making up the surrounding forest include Sigillaria scutellata and Lepidodendron aculeatum. The low ground cover includes various primitive ferns and mosses.␀␀,␀␀␀␀␀,␀␀␀␀␀Adobe Photoshop CS4 Windows␀2011:11:18 19:47:32␀Walter Myers␀␀Copyright Â© Walter Myers. All rights reserved.
